    'lab.intro.knight': 'Welcome to the Electronics Lab! 🔬 Practice with the simulators and complete missions to unlock new sections! ⚡',
    'lab.intro.voltage': 'Hi! I am Voltage ⚡ From now on I am right beside you in the Lab to help you feel the concepts with your own eyes.',
